// gaps (087 Avasta), an interview with true/false (087 Harjuta), a phone call with short answers (088 Harjuta).
// No new grammar item (METHODOLOGY_STANDARD §7 lists none for module 18); the module uses B1 grammar met earlier in
// function: des-form and the impersonal present in a monologue (086), indirect questions and the polite conditional in a
